; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - best trailing of M15 (tick replay): Bollinger trailing (TrailMode 10), setup 1 of 5: buy, session AllDay server time, trend filter none, target 3R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Trailing: stop beyond the Bollinger band SMA(20) -/+ 1 sd of M15, once the profit reaches 1R. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 10, TrailParam 0).
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (10 USD spread; score 1.61): 86 trades, PF 2.18. Tick replay of the same months: 86 trades, PF 2.35.
; TICK REPLAY (every tick, the EA's rules; Binance BTCUSDT one-second prices with a 10 USD spread, no commission). Unseen May 16 - Nov 13 2026: this setup 29 trades, PF 0.35, net -5.0R (stressed PF 0.33); the 5 setups of M15 + Bollinger together 169 trades, PF 0.96, net -2.4R (stressed 0.91).
; Bollinger was chosen as the best of the EA's trailing systems on M15 by that 2026 result: the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test. Even so the set lost money in those months (PF 0.96): it is here only because the zip has the best system of every timeframe.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (tick replay, same costs): this setup: 2024, 74 trades, PF 1.09; 2023 (from Jan 15), 63 trades, PF 1.12. The 5 setups together: 2024, 360 trades, PF 1.06; 2023 (from Jan 15), 359 trades, PF 0.84. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT, broker server time. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter was not in the backtest.
